          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima naahurira naagamba n'eiraka rihango, naagira ati: Imwe abarikurinda orurembo, mwirire haihi, buri muntu aine eky'okurwanisa ekirikucwekyereza omu ngaro ze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.8.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 8:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi reeba, haija abashaija mukaaga, baareetwa omu muhanda gw'eirembo rya ruguru, eririkureeba aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, buri omwe aine eky'okurwanisa ekirikwita omu ngaro ze; kandi ahakaba hariho ondiijo mushija, ojwaire ebijwaro bya kitaani, ari hamwe nabo, aine eihembe rya bwino aha izinio. Baataaha, baayemerera aha rubaju rw'eitambiro ry'omuringa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baashanga ekitiinsia kya Ruhanga wa Israeli kyatembire kuruga ahari baakerubi, ahu kyabaire kiba, kyahika aha murynago gw'enju. MUKAMA yaayeta ogwo mushaija owaabaire ajwaire ebijwaro bya kitaani, aine eihembe rya bwino aha izinio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.119.136"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 119:136",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.7.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kush 7:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaamugira ati: Irooko orabarabe omu rurembo Yerusaalemu, ote akamanyiso aha buso bw'abantu abarikutsinda nibabooga ahabw'ebihagaro byona ebirikukorerwamu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi abo bashaija mukaaga yaabagambira mpuriire, naagira ati: Mwirooko murabarabe omu rurembo mumukuratiire, mwite abantu; amaisho gaanyu garekye kusaasira, kandi mutagira ou mwagirira embabazi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 36:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.9.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kush 9:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mumareho abagurusi, abatsigazi, empangare, abaana bato n'abakazi; kwonka omuntu weena oine ako kamanyiso mutamukoraho. Kandi mutandikire omu Mwanya gwangye ogurikwera. Batyo baatandikira ahari abo bakuru abaabaire bari omu maisho g'enju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagaruka yaabagira ati: Mushiishe enju, kandi ebikaari byayo mubiijuze emitumbi. Mbwenu mwirooko mugyende. Batyo baagyenda, baita ab'omu rurembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.7.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 7:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.11.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "11:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku baabaire nibakibaita, naatsigara nyenka, naagwa ahansi njuumaire, naataka nti: Ai bambe, Mukama RUHANGA! Mbwenu omu kushuka ahari Yerusaalemu ekiniga kyawe nooyenda kumaraho Abaisraeli boona abatsigaireho?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
