        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima reeba, ogwo mushaija owaabaire ajwaire ebijwaro bya kitaani, aine eihembe rya bwino aha izinio, yaija, yaagamba ebi baamutuma, naagira ati: Naakora nk'oku wandagiira.",
          "type": "text",
